<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eagle Bancshares cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eagle Bancshares cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate/Johnson Lane said it cut Eagle Bancshares Inc to neutral from buy</p>
<p>--  Analyst cites &quot;lack of confidence&quot; in near-term earnings</p>
<p>-- Fiscal 1997 estimate reduced to $1.10 per share from $1.37</p>
<p>-- Fiscal 1998 estimate reduced to $1.35 per share from $1.60</p>
<p>-- Analysts say downside risk may be limited due to $12.36 per share book value, strong market for financial stocks</p>
<p>-- Eagle Bancshares off 1/4 to 15-1/4 in morning trade</p>
</text>
